sequenceDiagram
    %% SD2 - Pay for an order
    %% Stories: 6, 7, 24, 25, 26, 28, 31, 36, 37
    %% Description: The cashier offers payment methods and a tip, the order is paid, tickets go to the customer and the kitchen, and the kitchen is notified of the new order and of later changes.
    actor CS as Cashier (person)
    actor CUP as Customer (person)
    actor KE as Kitchen employee
    participant OD as Order
    participant PA as Payment

    %% covers 36, 37
    CS->>OD: offer payment methods and add tip
    OD->>PA: payment
    %% covers 24
    CUP->>PA: request payment confirmation
    %% covers 25, 26
    CS->>OD: print ticket for the customer
    %% covers 31
    CS->>OD: send digital ticket to the kitchen
    %% covers 6
    OD->>KE: notify of new order
    %% covers 28
    CS->>OD: change order after processing
    %% covers 7
    OD->>KE: notify kitchen of the change
